## Import

Pipeline authorizations are imported using `projectID/resourceType/resourceID/pipelineID`:

```shell
terraform import betterado_pipeline_authorization.example 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/endpoint/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/42
```
